---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import DualVideoPlayer from '../../components/DualVideoPlayer.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Thailand Khao Sok Adventures"
  description="Experience the thrill of jungle adventures in Khao Sok, Thailand. Join us for canoe trips, elephant bathing, bird watching, and more!"
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/khao-sok-bird-watching.jpg"
  heroTitle="Thailand Khao Sok Adventures"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Thailand Adventures", "href": "/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Explore Local Adventures in Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you are looking for excitement in the jungle, local adventures organized by Riverside Cottages provide the perfect start!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          In addition to canoe trips and river tubing, we also offer an elephant experience and bird watching – great ways to spend your days around Khao Sok Thailand!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <em>NOTE: Prices shown are per person</em>
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to plan your stay</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Choose a <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Package</a> with a set program for best value</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Or click the 'Plan Your Stay' buttons to create your own experiences.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Canoe Trip</span>
        </h2>
        <DualVideoPlayer
          landscapeSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/egWJBBH2wnY?rel=0"
          shortSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zy2jFostbls?rel=0"
          caption="Khao Sok Canoe Trip"
        />
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This is a classic Khao Sok Thailand adventure. Hop in a canoe as your guide paddles the boat down the river, pointing out monkeys playing in the trees, brightly colored kingfishers, and snakes snoozing in the trees above.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          During your journey, you will stop on the banks for a coffee break and a swim in the cool water. You'll continue down the river to soak up stunning views of limestone cliffs and forested riverbanks. For more information on this excursion, check out our Sabai Sabai Khao Sok <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Canoe Trip blog post</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> About one and one-half hours in the canoe, and fifteen minutes drive each way.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 750 THB for 2-3 people, 600 THB for 4+ people
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-1 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Relaxing for adults, exhilarating for kids, this activity is a favorite! Guests will only get wet if they want to, yet it is a good idea to bring a plastic bag to store electronics during the rainy season.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Thailand River Tubing</span>
        </h2>
        <DualVideoPlayer
          landscapeSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/PGKcWLkEwcc?rel=0"
          shortSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/swwhIFjC2xw?rel=0"
          caption="River Tubing Adventure"
        />
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          When the river is high enough, river tubing is a favorite Khao Sok Thailand adventure! Hop on a rubber tube at the top of the river and ride down it to Riverside Cottages. Since river tubing requires strong currents, guides will accompany you to make sure your ride is both fun AND safe! In the calmer parts of the river, they can point out monkeys, birds, and snakes sleeping in the trees.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For those who think they are too old for this kind of stuff, don’t be silly: be a kid again and tube the river! Check out <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">our blog</a> for more info.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 1-2 hours, depending on the speed of the river.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 500 THB for 2 people, 450 THB for 3+ people
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-2 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Because this trip encounters deep water and strong currents, it is recommended for people who are comfortable swimming.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Elephant Experience</span>
        </h2>
        <DualVideoPlayer
          landscapeSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/y79jHMnYwrA?rel=0"
          shortSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/MTOi80Jw-yg?rel=0"
          caption="Ethical Elephant Encounter"
        />
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We do not offer elephant rides, but after careful research and years of observation, we have developed 2 truly delightful elephant-friendly experiences that are cruelty free.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Elephant Experience</strong> – Visit a family-run elephant camp, and learn what it’s like to own an elephant. This is a unique opportunity to feed, bathe, and care for one of nature’s most amazing creatures.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Elephant Bath</strong> – A shorter program that focuses on having fun while helping the elephants during their bathing time.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you would like to learn more, read our <a href="/faq-category/elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Elephant Experience FAQ</a> or discover more about the <a href="/asian-elephant-khao-sok-national-park-elephant/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Asian Elephant in Khao Sok National Park</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> The drive is 20 minutes each way and you spend about 90 minutes with the elephant for the Elephant Experience, and about 45 minutes with the elephant for the bathing program.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:<br /> </strong>Bathing – 1,200 THBds<br /> Experience – 1,500 THB for 2 people, 1,200 THB for 3+ people<strong><br /> </strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-3 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Both tours include a bathing activity, so bring a change of clothes and a towel!
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Cave, Raft, Hike Half-Day Tour</span>
        </h2>
        <DualVideoPlayer
          landscapeSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZUxe5ks1X9Q?rel=0"
          shortSrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/g0Y6eYCNlrM?rel=0"
          caption="Cave, Raft & Hike Tour"
        />
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Experience a taste of all that Khao Sok has to offer. This half day tour includes relaxing rafting on the Sok River, jungle trekking deep into <a href="/khlong-phanom-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khlong Phanom</a> National Park and Cave exploration. You will be expertly led by one of our local guides.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Experience the mountains from your bamboo raft and hike to the fossils in Tam Kaew /<a href="/khao-sok-cave-exploring-the-crystal-chamber/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Crystal cave</a>. Throughout the day, keep your eyes open to see 3 species of monkey, giant hornbills, and even gibbons if you are lucky! Lunch will be delicious Thai food served at a local restaurant.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Read our <a href="/khao-sok-cave-raft-hike-tour/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">detailed guide to the Cave, Raft & Hike adventure</a> to learn what the experience is really like.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 4-5 hours, moderate hiking
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 1,700 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-4 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>This hike is for people who can hike up and down steep terrain. Don’t forget money for the entrance ticket to the National Park.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Thailand Bird Watching</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/khao-sok-bird-watching.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Bird Watching"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Bird Watching</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok Thailand is home to a wide variety of birds, including the great argus, hornbills, pittas, sunbirds, and other unusual species. In addition to year-round species, different migratory birds appear in the dry season (November to April) and during the monsoon (May to October).
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Join our knowledgeable local guides on this excursion to learn about bird behavior and their unique calls. All ages will enjoy this adventure, which will likely include a few primate sightings as well.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> Half day or full day.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 1,700 THB for 2 people, 1,500 THB for 3+ people
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-5 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Bring your own binoculars, and book in advance because our Khao Sok Thailand bird guide is often busy.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Jungle Camping</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/jungle-camping.jpg"
            alt="Jungle camping - Khao Sok"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Jungle camping - Khao Sok</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Go into the heart of the rainforest for one or two nights. Highly experienced guides will accompany you deep into Khao Sok National Park. You will get to know about the plants and animals of the Thai jungle, and learn more about how to adapt to the tropical environment. Enjoy jungle-style Thai dishes, and spend a peaceful night sleeping in a hammock. Your guide will teach you how to stay alive, how to build a shelter, and how to cook with bamboo.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 1-2 nights, with a private guide and ranger.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 3,000 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-6 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>This trip is for people who like being outdoors and are comfortable in nature.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Looking for something like this? Be sure to read about our <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-adventure-journey-meuang-chon/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">deep-jungle camping trip</a> to the abandoned Chon Tin Mine!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/packages-call-to-action.jpg"
            alt="Enjoying Khao Sok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Enjoying Khao Sok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the most popular activities<br /> and the best value
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the most popular activities<br /> and the best value
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
